Dear distance samplers,

I am new to the DISTANCE software and working on CDS analysis of a line-transect vessel survey data-set for a species of dolphin, using the Windows version.

The collection was stratified by geographic region, and I intended to estimate the density for each stratum as well as globally.

My settings of encounter rate, detection function and cluster size were all at stratum level.

My question is if I can and how to apply different truncations to different strata.

Thanks,
Eugene

