Eugene

Interesting and very clearly-described question.  There is no simply way using Distance 7 to specify stratum-specific truncation distances.  You could use the blunt method of editing the data outside Distance before importing.  However the deeper question to ask is why truncation distance might differ between strata.  I've not encountered a situation in which I would have wanted stratum-specific truncation distances.

